{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "106e01305e15a809180b901830caa97b6f366deae12143242e6a8dc6656b9590", "ja": "ショータイムはこれから", "zh": "表演时间现在才要开始", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "66e3d585f4263c6f22881f86c65fddee4e9acac755b3ed6bb895e812d0df5f69", "ja": "トークパート収録は終了。楽しかったとしか\n言えなかったと語る琴葉だが、本心だから\nこそ伝わってきたと答えるプロデューサー。\nみんなと歩むこれからが、もっと楽しみと\n琴葉は笑って、歌の収録へと挑むのだった。", "zh": "谈话环节的录音结束了。琴叶说，自己只能说“很开心”，而制作人回答道，正因为那是她的真心话，所以才传达了出来。想到今后能和大家一起走下去，琴叶笑着说更加期待了，随后便投入到歌曲的录音中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ce9e349b7accc337eb74cc87333470975b17dc1944e728c9d4553864a8db2199", "ja": "番組トークパート収録本番中……", "zh": "节目谈话环节正式录制中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1001_mcmgomadango", "source_sha256": "d68211be01a84234f646ad54ca38f06e82871501ce9e62a16dc2f9506a7f8742", "ja": "ありがとう環ちゃん、後でお友達の話、聞かせてね！\nそして最後のメンバーは、リーダーのこの方！", "zh": "谢谢环，待会儿再跟我讲讲朋友们的事吧！\n接下来是最后一位成员，也就是队长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "67a544e893b2cdf3eb7886a59dba874f11a5a9c828ab5d2013e08636e3082515", "ja": "は、はいっ！　MILLIONSTARS Team3rd、\n田中琴葉です。よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "是、是的！我是MILLIONSTARS Team3rd的田中琴叶。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1003_mcmgomadango", "source_sha256": "58003daefe46f8f6f925a50d056eec43186d04bb62f58c29180a5cbf94fe8ac4", "ja": "えーと、琴葉ちゃんは18歳の高校3年生で……\nおお、写真集でも最高の笑顔！　弾けてますね～。", "zh": "嗯，琴叶是18岁的高中3年级学生……  \n哦，在写真集里也是最棒的笑容！真是活力四射呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "954579928085a3456904a1434fdc81cd9d82d04127b543a795f47d2e5f256439", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。\nとにかく一生懸命、いろんなポーズを取りました。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……。\n总之，我拼尽全力摆出了各种姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1005_mcmgomadango", "source_sha256": "3dd3018f87cd8cbdeab64a8da1cbc3e8bc6c701f230ee9d8338e15bd112098a0", "ja": "お？　プロフィールに書いてありますけど、\n演劇部所属？　てことは、女優さん志望だ？", "zh": "哦？资料里写着，你是戏剧部的成员？\n也就是说，你想当演员？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "70541a6241a2ad66294f63cad2c8230ea8c88d5d7fd34a1ec8f7a72c6ffb1c65", "ja": "そ、そうですね。お芝居にも、\nいつか挑戦したいって思ってます。", "zh": "是、是这样的。我也想着将来有机会挑战一下演戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1007_mcmgomadango", "source_sha256": "2c8235a4b29b96fc7f4ceba7b93dbe9ec3103d2f42a7d363fce4490d4e295fe1", "ja": "じゃあ今はアイドルの仕事をして、\nこう、お芝居という名の畑を耕してるわけですね？", "zh": "那么现在是在做偶像的工作，\n也就是在耕耘名为“戏剧”的田地，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1008_mcmgomadango", "source_sha256": "eb47e29739ddd3c7862e4137a2f2002984848595d4371c4947d590bb9b377fe3", "ja": "うん、どんな経験でも芸の肥やしっていうし\nアイドルだと、いろんな仕事があるでしょ？", "zh": "嗯，毕竟常言道任何经历都是艺术的养分，\n而且当偶像的话，也会有各种各样的工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "4081302561851156426d6dd97f509e03b8b974d0ffc39d43042e3242e6a3fcbe", "ja": "はい……。劇場に来てから本当に、\nいろんな経験をさせてもらっています。", "zh": "是的……来到剧场之后，我真的经历了各种各样的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1010_mcmgomadango", "source_sha256": "3054f0677270586f92d22a3938e0ff63e79320796186da2842f00fe6dfa5de73", "ja": "デビューは水着でバトったもんね。さぞ貴重な肥やしに\n……いやさすがに無理か。めっちゃ貴重だけど！", "zh": "出道时可是穿着泳装对决的呢。想必会成为非常宝贵的养分……\n……不，果然还是太勉强了。虽然确实非常宝贵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1011_staff", "source_sha256": "2f785d79a3a4245e95f0aedd3e3ee44eb9ad9d3948fefdfa758c4600e7d10bc2", "ja": "（ハハハハハ！）", "zh": "（哈哈哈哈哈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "e546954f642bdd8be2c8549c157f17033ced5e90b92694a86af9bf89ccd8931e", "ja": "……。いえ、あの……\nなってる、かもしれません。", "zh": "……。没、那个……\n可能确实变成那样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1013_mcmgomadango", "source_sha256": "6ac28a7f9e104b9881cef1a3c6961dc13e1a791f77a45bb5e2516dd9ab5ed248", "ja": "え、ホントに？", "zh": "诶，真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "4fa04851dbd6e47f783a73a4e95fce92162defde7309a9d534b5f472630dffd6", "ja": "……私、最初はとにかく、\n頑張らなきゃって思っていたんです。", "zh": "……我一开始的时候，\n只是觉得无论如何都必须努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "619855a2348c65bb5c322af31737f6dfdd93bb023ac333a9003a38ec691532df", "ja": "でも、みんなで頑張っているうちに……。\n一緒に頑張れること自体が、一番大事になって。", "zh": "可是，在和大家一起努力的过程中……我渐渐觉得，能够一起努力这件事本身，才是最重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1016_mcmgomadango", "source_sha256": "245f2003aeb54b468c5c40b8684390be3c4d8103b45eb3b2769b594d8257f364", "ja": "……なるほど。\n写真集の撮影も嬉しかった？", "zh": "……原来如此。\n拍摄写真集也很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "c777e75b54e5e9178f6f4d5005b9d9666b2a8c0db548341ac1848a575099597a", "ja": "撮影は、気が付いたら……楽しんでしまっていました。\nみんなと何をするのも新鮮で、夢中で。", "zh": "拍摄的时候，不知不觉间……我竟然享受其中了。  \n和大家一起做什么都觉得很新鲜，让人全神贯注。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "b6d7004d0a1de75fe76d9777418f80394de5d6d31e7b800d0bf6218ca74f18b8", "ja": "お仕事なのに、こんなに楽しくていいのかなって思う\nくらい。そんなこと、全然想定してなかったのに……", "zh": "甚至觉得，明明是在工作，\n这么开心真的好吗。我明明完全没有设想过这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "072d796647f8d47de3e13bdfe4afe952da2d9b0134fa81675851068dfe145e7b", "ja": "私は、仲間と一緒に……\n一緒の時間を過ごすことが、きっと……。", "zh": "我，和大家在一起……\n和同伴共度的时光，一定……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1020_mcmgomadango", "source_sha256": "22f30fb314fdafcb0a937b86889a013496ec39f1a0f421d3ee0efd440e506174", "ja": "……つまり、そんな琴葉ちゃんの最高に楽しい瞬間が、\nこの写真集には詰まってるわけだ！　これは必見！", "zh": "……也就是说，琴叶这本写真集里，\n凝聚了她最开心的瞬间！这绝对不容错过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "e911c83c8e3a8e48707f90bf2b0e4697f413dcb9c60e37eb19459670b668dce2", "ja": "あ……は、はい！　この写真集を見て、\n楽しい気持ちになってもらえたら、嬉しいです。", "zh": "啊……嗯、好的！如果大家看了这本写真集，能感到开心，我就很高兴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "d97074e42fee2f64709f4150e91be527b967b90cab2d70b59ea0a65c15a16bea", "ja": "私たちTeam3rd、これからも頑張ります。\n新曲ともども、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我们Team3rd，今后也会继续努力的。新曲也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1023_null", "source_sha256": "517dbfc763eac030e53e553509d3272df8ce7466ebbc0ec590ad674c7d0c961f", "ja": "トークパート終了後……", "zh": "谈话环节结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "fc5bd9e357ce8affaab90832336974444e5ca05beea3ca23da8234018c75f7f5", "ja": "プロデューサー、お疲れ様でした。あの……、\nう、うまく出来たでしょうか…？", "zh": "制作人，辛苦了。那个……  \n我、我表现得还好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "b90d59e8a8417b6e209ad9be206b102a052d68c8f1fa3571e914a26d0f816bdb", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだよ！　写真集だけじゃなくて、\n配信中のデビューイベントの宣伝もできたからな！", "zh": "啊，做得非常棒！不仅宣传了写真集，\n还宣传了直播中的出道活动呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "45a866186a63a558ede915462ea4358e665e810f7a9832431e690fb60ac15e49", "ja": "本当ですか？　よかった……！　調べてきたこと\n全然言えなかったから、どうしようかと思いました。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了……！因为我完全没能说出自己查到的那些事，还在想该怎么办呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "adf82f0b0c8017754812fa1795c9c18cf91b94ef1f933f6baf8d37a8e81c2dd3", "ja": "？　何を調べてきたんだ？", "zh": "？你去调查什么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "b556c874f7e6134c7b3b3fdf4fe329757ea345bfa93c3b90cce75f3076e2a111", "ja": "番組の過去回を全部見て、話題になった単語を拾って\nおいたんです。でも、言えるタイミングがなくて……。", "zh": "我把节目过去的内容全都看了一遍，还整理出了引发话题的词语。不过，一直没找到合适的时机说出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "87ee84b55e8c1f029abf1234efca6cafc0fec602f1e37d64147f87af9cb62928", "ja": "えっ、全部？　そ、そっか……。まあ、ゴマダンゴ\nさんからの振りも無かったし、いいんじゃないかな！", "zh": "诶，全部？这、这样啊……不过，ゴマダンゴ老师也没给你递话，应该没关系吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "5eb38dfcf34e42b85f271aebc6cb495b46d40efd10438c7396f8fdaf6b49363f", "ja": "……そうですね。さすが、お話の上手な方でした。\n最後もきれいにまとめてくださって。", "zh": "……是啊。不愧是擅长聊天的人。\n最后也帮我们漂亮地收了尾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "d20ff8302b60f90def01354464ec7032030829dc8fb98c4daca5febcf8661c81", "ja": "振り返ってみると、私……\n「楽しかった」っていう感想しか言えてなかったのに。", "zh": "回想起来，我……明明只能说出“很开心”这样的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_05_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "c59e43599b7cd45d4f570badf9db52fda1b4a6e8bf72d6af946671df71d047e7", "ja": "でも、それが本心だって、すごく伝わってきたよ。\nだからこそ、上手くまとめてもらえたんだと思う。", "zh": "但是，我能非常清楚地感受到，那就是你的真心话。\n也正因为如此，我想你才能帮我很好地总结出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
